  "significance": "SH 10, Gurumathakal–Maindargi State Highway, crosses the border between Telangana, Karnataka and Maharashtra. A state road that runs through more than one state has no single owner — Telangana R&B, Karnataka PWD and Maharashtra PWD each maintain the stretch inside their own state, so which department to contact depends on where along the road you are.",
